1le5|n|A whitish woolly plant (Teucrium Polium) of the order Labiatae, found throughout the Mediterranean region. The name, with sundry prefixes, is sometimes given to other related species of the same genus.	a:17zd,69,6~17zd,69,6	N:ujc,84,1;ghz,71,2~ghz,71,2;ujc,84,1
